T1  - Trophic status and density of zooxanthellae population in hermatypic corals.
TT  - Troficheskij status i plotnost' populyatsii zooksantell v germatipnykh korallakh
AN  - 17776645; 4828602
AB  - The experimental data and theoretical concepts of the trophic status of symbiotic zooxanthellae as well as machanisms controlling their number in hermatypic corals are discussed. Zooxanthellae growth in native coral is nitrogen unlimited. The major mechanism regulating the population density of zooxanthellae is their digestion by the host.
