TY  - JOUR
T1  - Nutrient limitation in the giant clam-zooxanthellae symbiosis: Effects of nutrient supplements on growth of the symbiotic partners
AN  - 208073574; 01962330
AB  - The effect of ammonium and phosphate on the growth of the giant clam Tridacna gigas and its symbiotic dinoflagellate Symbiodinium species was examined.  Results show strong evidence that ammonium-limitation of clam zooxanthellae is a function of the availability of ammonium to the symbiosis while, irrespective of nutrient levels in sea water, clam zooxanthellae still show characteristics of phosphate-limitation.
