TY  - JOUR
T1  - Growth-irradiance relationships in phytoplankton.
AN  - 14190659; 999453
AB  - The steady state growth rates of three species of marine phytoplankton, Thalassiosira weisflogii, Isochrysis galbana and Prorocentrum micans , were followed in turbidostat culture. At each growth irradiance, photosynthesis and respiration were measured by following changes in oxygen. Together with measurements of optical absorption cross sections, cellular chlorophyll, carbon and nitrogen, and excretion rates as well as knowledge of the quantum flux, the quantum requirement for growth and photosynthesis were calculated.
