TY  - JOUR
T1  - (What role do algae play in the life of corals? 1.Coral reefs by recycling).
TT  - Welche Rolle spielen algen im Leben von Korallen? 1.Korallenriffe durch Recycling
AN  - 17980714; 5258995
AB  - The strong correlation of the paucity of nutrients in warm seas and the occurrence of symbiosis between various benthonic animals and zooxanthellae there is interpreted as a nutrition economical recycling process. As zooxanthellae increase the calcification ratio in lime- secreting animals, especially in corals, the symbiosis yields the sideeffect that the algae-enhanced skeleton growth enables these hermatypic corals to compensate for destructions by waves and bioerosion and to build the framework of coral reefs.
