TY  - JOUR
T1  - Plankton as a factor in the nitrogen and phosphorous cycles in the sea.
AN  - 18516658; 5498991
AB  - This subject is reviewed under the following headings: introduction; the chemical forms of nitrogen and phosphorous dissolved in sea water; the stoichiometry of biologically induced changes in nutrient levels; uptake of nitrogen compounds by phytoplankton; the effect of nutrient levels on phytoplankton growth kinetics; nitrogen and phosphorous levels in phytoplankton; the assimilation of nitrogen and phosphorous by zooplankton; levels of nitrogen and phosphorous in zooplankton; nitrogen and phosphorous excretion by zooplankton; growth of zooplankton in terms of nitrogen and phosphorous; and plankton production and nutrient levels in certain sea areas.
